msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-jae-jfb110.rst:310
#: 9c886c7a806d42abad35bf446d33f116
msgid "The RC In pin, is mapped to a timer input  and can be used for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS, FPort, and SRXL2 which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this manner, can provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-jae-jfb110.rst:312
#: a89146c9839149949d3e4c99a879e769
msgid "An alternate RC input is setup on SERIAL5 RX input and provides the same capabilities as above except it does not support PPM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-jae-jfb110.rst:314
#: f11b85de84014e89b3c5ae96d6ad3f99
msgid "To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in FPort, CRSF, and SRXL2 receivers, any full UART with DMA can be assigned to be used as the RC connection instead of the PPM pin. For example SERIAL4 could be re-assigned as RC input."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-jae-jfb110.rst:316
#: 565e67acd3b64fe3900c1b459d18f453
msgid "With this option, :ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` must be set to \"23\", :ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` must be changed to some other protocol than its default of \"23\" (only one UART is allowed to have that protocol in a system), and:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-jae-jfb110.rst:318
#: a4bcb1e799eb40578d70f30e989888ed
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-jae-jfb110.rst:320
#: 7279681564c14c9cbfbc8ab6abd1ecbd
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX  pin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-jae-jfb110.rst:322
#: b414b99c4bfd466eabc35f6dfb3ed6d6
msgid "FPort requires connection to TX. and setting :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` = 7 (invert TX/RX, Half Duplex)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-jae-jfb110.rst:324
#: cf919055a1464275a8d4f4c95605d5ef
msgid "CRSF also requires a TX connection, in addition to RX, and automatically provides telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-jae-jfb110.rst:326
#: cc6a08d208e748b48aa3c3352d5b2b9f
msgid "SRXL2 requires a connection to TX and automatically provides telemetry.  Set :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""

